# "If you sacrificed a Klingon this way" reads the sacrificed creature as it last existed on the battlefield (CR 608.2h):
# L'Rell, Fierce Visionary's 2/1 Klingon Warrior token, sacrificed to Gowron's ability, has ceased to exist by the time the
# ability resolves (CR 111.7, 704.5d), and Bot1 still draws a card and loses 1 life. Each token dying puts a +1/+1 counter
# on Gowron (another creature died): turn 1's, sacrificed by L'Rell's delayed trigger at that end step, and this one.

